OL,3,GNEWSAPara-snooker player missed flight
OL,4,Aover hoist issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FWizz Air said it "sincerely apologises"
OL,7,Ffor what happened and said it would
OL,8,Flearn from mistakes to improve disabled
OL,9,Ftravellers' experiences.
